OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after viable device
OL,4,Afound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has been charged after
OL,7,Fa viable device was found in County
OL,8,FArmagh.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the Carrive Road
OL,11,Farea of Silverbridge shortly after
OL,12,F08:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FA controlled explosion was later
OL,15,Fcarried out on the device by ammunition
OL,16,Ftechnical officers.
OL,18,FThe 22-year-old has been charged with
OL,19,Fwith possessing explosives in
OL,20,Fsuspicious circumstances and a number
OL,21,Fof drug offences.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
